DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T150000
DTSTAMP:20260714T124330Z
CREATED:20260713T160414Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260714T124330Z
UID:51532-1785063600-1785078000@beachmetro.com
SUMMARY:Quack Fest
DESCRIPTION:QUACK FEST is a family-friendly duck extravaganza in the park! The community is invited to register for an all-ages movement and sound workshop\, followed by an interactive performance of “to – or to not to?” by Litt Dance Collective. This piece will feature live music\, contemporary dance\, and the sound of real and rubber ducks. There are two time slots to choose from at 11am & 1pm. Duck-themed merch will be available by donation and light refreshments will be provided. This event is Free/PWYC.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/quack-fest/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/13120416/QUACK-FESTSM.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Beach Metro Community News
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T190000
DTSTAMP:20260714T124241Z
CREATED:20260713T160539Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260714T124241Z
UID:51535-1785085200-1785092400@beachmetro.com
SUMMARY:Dance & Draw
DESCRIPTION:Dance & Draw is a container for dancers and visual artists to connect and create. The activity will be an open improvisation jam for dancers and an opportunity for visual artists to draw moving bodies! It will begin with a guided somatic meditation and warmup\, which all artists will be invited to do. After that\, artists will be invited to sit along the perimeter of the space and engage in introductions. Following that there will be 10-15 prompts shared (1 per song) where dancers will enter or exit the space as they choose and artists can draw the dancers. The session will end with a closing conversation to reflect on the experience and a 20-minute social for micro conversations!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/dance-draw/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/13120541/AbbeySM.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
